Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?=E2=9A=A1=EF=B8=8F=20Defer=20building=20the=20O?=
 =?UTF-8?q?penAPI=20models=20to=20their=20first=20use?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The models in fastapi.openapi.models are only used to generate the OpenAPI
schema, but pydantic built their validators and serializers at import time,
on every `import fastapi`, even for apps that disable OpenAPI.

With `defer_build` they are built on first use: when the schema is generated
or a model is instantiated. Apps that never generate the schema never pay for
them. The explicit `model_rebuild()` calls are no longer needed, pydantic
resolves the forward references when the deferred build happens.

Squashed from the models.py changes of
https://github.com/rjtokenring/fastapi/tree/perf/defer-openapi-model-build
(eb2be3e1, 771399a2), made against FastAPI 0.142.2: the file is unchanged
in 0.141.1, the version in uv.lock.
---
 fastapi/openapi/models.py | 16 ++++++++++------
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/fastapi/openapi/models.py b/fastapi/openapi/models.py
index ca26bf93..fbaa3fc9 100644
--- a/fastapi/openapi/models.py
+++ b/fastapi/openapi/models.py
@@ -55,7 +55,10 @@ except ImportError:  # pragma: no cover
 
 
 class BaseModelWithConfig(BaseModel):
-    model_config = {"extra": "allow"}
+    # These models are only used to generate the OpenAPI schema, build them on
+    # first use instead of at import time: faster startup and less memory for apps
+    # that never generate it, which matters on small and edge devices
+    model_config = {"extra": "allow", "defer_build": True}
 
 
 class Contact(BaseModelWithConfig):
@@ -93,10 +96,16 @@ class Server(BaseModelWithConfig):
 
 
 class Reference(BaseModel):
+    # See BaseModelWithConfig
+    model_config = {"defer_build": True}
+
     ref: str = Field(alias="$ref")
 
 
 class Discriminator(BaseModel):
+    # See BaseModelWithConfig
+    model_config = {"defer_build": True}
+
     propertyName: str
     mapping: dict[str, str] | None = None
 
@@ -428,8 +437,3 @@ class OpenAPI(BaseModelWithConfig):
     security: list[dict[str, list[str]]] | None = None
     tags: list[Tag] | None = None
     externalDocs: ExternalDocumentation | None = None
-
-
-Schema.model_rebuild()
-Operation.model_rebuild()
-Encoding.model_rebuild()
